  "paperdoll": {
    "_comment": "flicker-paperdoll's in-scene HUD (behaviour: Alpha/flicker-paperdoll/scripts/hud.lua). Replaces the POC keypress toggles + draw_text overlay. `inventory` = the equip-slot bar; a slot's piece is drawn only while its cell is lit. Slot keys are the contract with the engine: it publishes `slot_<key>_loaded`/`slot_<key>_on` on the Model and reads `slot_<key>` back. Sheaths have no cell by design — they are always worn (no sheath/unsheath animations yet).",
    "inventory": {
